From: IHulkSmashI <227083792+IHulkSmashI@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 16:34:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Game list: only games ClawDeck can set up, as the supported-games list lists
 only supported games

A game shows when it ships DLSS, FSR 2/3/3.1 or XeSS (looked for 6 folders deep, where Unreal keeps its DLSS
plugin) or is in the per-game list. The answer is cached per game until its folder changes (walking an SD card is
slow). A running game that has none says so instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019jJLUgw5uVPaAcLuRF5SqW
